================================================================================
                        FLEXSPACE SYSTEM FEATURES
                          Complete Feature List
================================================================================

This document lists all features of the FlexSpace platform.

================================================================================
PART 1: WHAT USERS SEE AND USE (Frontend)
================================================================================

1. FINDING A SPACE
   - See coworking spaces on a map (Google Maps)
   - Get driving directions to any space
   - Find spaces near your current location
   - Filter spaces by price, amenities, rating, and location

2. MAKING A BOOKING
   - Book a desk or room in real time
   - See if a space is available instantly
   - Get live updates when availability changes
   - Walk-in booking (no reservation needed)
   - Works on desktop, tablet, or phone (PWA = installs like an app)

3. USER DASHBOARD
   - See your upcoming and past bookings
   - Track loyalty points you've earned
   - View your activity history

4. REVIEWS & RATINGS
   - Rate spaces you've visited
   - Leave written feedback
   - Upload photos with your review
   - QR code on receipt to leave review after booking

5. LOYALTY POINTS & VOUCHERS
   - Earn points every time you book (₱20 = 1 point)
   - Redeem points for discount vouchers (20 points = ₱1)
   - Use vouchers on future bookings
   - Space owners can create their own promo vouchers
   - Admins can create platform-wide vouchers

6. AI CHAT SUPPORT (Flex Support)
   - Ask questions in Hiligaynon, Tagalog, or English
   - Get space recommendations by district (e.g., "Molo?", "Jaro?")
   - Ask for prices, booking help, or directions
   - Ask who developed the platform or who the team is
   - See when the chatbot is online/offline
   - Messages auto-scroll and support bold text & bullet points
   - Chat can understand follow-up questions

7. USER ACCOUNTS
   - Sign up with email and password
   - Or log in with your Google account
   - Reset password via email OTP (one-time code)
   - Change your password anytime
   - Edit your profile information

8. SPACE OWNER FEATURES
   - Add and manage your own spaces
   - Upload images of your space
   - List amenities (WiFi, parking, etc.)
   - Create staff accounts to help manage bookings
   - Upload GCash or Maya QR codes for payments
   - See real-time occupancy and revenue
   - Track payouts and transaction history
   - Create promo vouchers for your space
   - Assign spaces to districts (Molo, Jaro, etc.)
   - Manage reviews left by users

9. ADMIN FEATURES
   - See platform-wide analytics (users, revenue, top spaces)
   - Approve or reject new space owner applications
   - Approve or block users and space owners
   - Create global vouchers for everyone
   - Turn on maintenance mode
   - Track platform commission earnings
   - View system logs (who did what, when)
   - Monitor the queue system (emails, image uploads)
   - Manage locations and districts
   - Change system settings

10. LANDING PAGE (public, no login required)
    - See featured spaces
    - Learn how FlexSpace works
    - View platform information before signing up

================================================================================
PART 2: POINT OF SALE (POS) SYSTEM
================================================================================

11. WALK-IN MANAGEMENT
    - Create walk-in bookings without prior reservation
    - Select space or private room for walk-in
    - Choose between open time (all day) or fixed hourly schedule
    - Auto-calculate bill based on actual time spent
    - Support for open time (unlimited hours) or hourly rates
    - Real-time check-in and check-out tracking

12. POS PAYMENT PROCESSING
    - Calculate bill instantly based on time spent
    - Apply discount vouchers before checkout
    - Process cash payments with change calculation
    - Generate QR code for GCash/Maya payments
    - Print receipt after successful payment
    - Send email receipt to customer

13. INVENTORY MANAGEMENT
    - Track product inventory for coworking spaces
    - Add products (food, drinks, merchandise) to sell
    - Update stock levels automatically when sold
    - Low stock alerts and warnings
    - Categorize products for easy organization

14. CUSTOMER ORDERS
    - Create customer orders for products
    - Add multiple items to a single order
    - Calculate order totals with tax
    - Process order payments separately from bookings
    - Track order status (pending, preparing, completed)
    - View order history per customer

15. STAFF POS ACCESS
    - Staff can process walk-in bookings
    - Staff can handle product sales
    - Staff cannot access financial reports
    - All staff actions are logged for audit

================================================================================
PART 3: PAYMENT & EARNINGS SYSTEM
================================================================================

16. PAYMENT METHODS
    - Cash (walk-in payments only)
    - GCash (via PayMongo/PayBridge)
    - Maya (via PayMongo/PayBridge)
    - Credit/Debit Cards (via PayMongo)
    - Bank Transfer (via PayMongo)
    - PayPal (via PayMongo)
    - Loyalty Points (redeem for vouchers)

17. ONLINE PAYMENT FLOW
    - Customer books space/room online
    - Redirected to secure payment page
    - Choose payment method (GCash, Maya, Card, etc.)
    - Complete payment on payment provider's page
    - Redirected back to success page
    - Booking auto-confirmed after successful payment
    - Email receipt automatically sent

18. PLATFORM FEE SYSTEM
    - Configurable platform fee percentage (default: 2-10%)
    - Fee automatically calculated per booking
    - Separate tracking for online vs walk-in payments
    - Space owners see pending fees in dashboard
    - Red badge notification for unpaid fees
    - One-click pay platform fees via GCash/Maya
    - Fee status: 'pending' or 'collected'
    - Monthly breakdown of fees and earnings

19. EARNINGS TRACKER
    - Combined view of booking earnings + POS sales
    - Gross revenue vs net earnings after fees
    - Platform commission tracking
    - Export reports to CSV or PDF
    - Filter by date range (today, week, month, year)
    - Search transaction history
    - Voucher discount tracking
    - Walk-in vs online booking breakdown

20. PAYMENT SECURITY
    - PayMongo API keys encrypted before storage
    - PayBridge middleware for secure key handling
    - HTTPS for all payment-related endpoints
    - Webhook signature verification
    - Idempotency prevents duplicate payments
    - No plain-text API keys stored

================================================================================
PART 4: BOOKING MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
================================================================================

21. BOOKING TYPES
    - Online bookings (pre-paid via payment gateway)
    - Walk-in bookings (pay at counter)
    - Open time bookings (all day access)
    - Fixed schedule bookings (specific hours)

22. BOOKING WORKFLOW
    - Pending → Confirmed → Active → Completed
    - Or Pending → Rejected/Cancelled
    - Active status when customer checks in via QR
    - Completed when payment is processed

23. QR CODE SYSTEM
    - Unique QR code generated per booking
    - QR code for check-in (scan at space)
    - QR code for review (scan after completion)
    - QR code for payment (GCash/Maya)

24. ROOM BOOKING
    - Book specific rooms within a space
    - Room capacity tracking
    - Room availability calendar
    - Different rates per room
    - Room amenities displayed

