PART 9: TECHNOLOGY STACK (For Reference)
================================================================================

Frontend: React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, Leaflet maps, Framer Motion
Backend: Node.js, Express, MongoDB, Mongoose
AI: Google Gemini API
Real-time: Socket.io
Security: JWT, Bcrypt, Cloudflare Turnstile
Queue: Bull, Redis
Storage: Cloudinary (images), MongoDB (data)
Email: Nodemailer, Gmail SMTP
Payments: PayMongo API, PayBridge Middleware
Container: Docker
Deployment: Vercel (frontend), Render (backend)

